      "code": "if ((ctxt != NULL) && (ctxt->vstateNr != 0)) {",
      "role": "root_cause",
      "note": "The safety condition for reader streaming is that the validation state is active; when it is not, xmlAddRef stores the live attr pointer in ret->attr even though the reader may later free that attribute."
    },
